  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced. Cut potato into bite-sized chunks. Cut carrot into half-moons.\n• Place on the lined oven tray. Sprinkle over garlic seasoning. Drizzle with olive oil and season. Toss to coat.\n• Roast until tender, 20-25 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6285a51a0004ef5aab09db31/step-98c29bb9.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a small bowl, combine basil pesto and garlic aioli and a splash of water. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6285a51a0004ef5aab09db31/step-767879c4.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• When the veggies have 10 mins remaining, cut falafel into quarters.\n• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil (1/4 cup for 2P / 1/2 cup for 4P) over medium-high heat.\n• Cook falafel until golden, 5-6 mins.\n• Transfer to a paper towel-lined plate.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6285a51a0004ef5aab09db31/step-d2472eb2.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, roughly chop tomato. To the tray with the roast veggies, add tomato, baby spinach and a drizzle of white wine vinegar and olive oil. Season. (Combine on the tray to save on washing up!).\n• Divide spinach falafel, roast veggies medley between bowls. Drizzle the pesto aioli dressing over the falafel.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6285a51a0004ef5aab09db31/step-2ce82654.jpg"
    }
  ]
